# Normalise text files to LF in the repository and working tree.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Notebooks: left untouched until their outputs are stripped (PLAN step 0.3),
# to avoid re-adding multi-megabyte blobs to history.
*.ipynb -text

# Binary assets
*.wav binary
*.png binary
*.gif binary
*.pdf binary
*.pptx binary
*.adv binary
